//! Red Queen Evolution — Adversarial co-evolving test suite for scp-isolate.
//!
//! Generated by deterministic adversarial evolution protocol.
//! These tests target mutation-surviving code paths, missing invariants,
//! and edge cases not covered by the existing 140-test suite.
//!
//! Dimensions:
//! - state-machine-exhaustive: Every transition pair validated
//! - guard-invariants: RAII lifecycle edge cases
//! - event-exhaustiveness: All 17 event variants exercised
//! - dag-adversarial: Cycle detection, diamond patterns, removal order
//! - checkpoint-risk: Classification boundary conditions
//! - hint-generation: State-driven hint coverage gaps
//! - type-invariants: ID validation, serialization, equality

